BYOK Claude Opus 5 vision not enabled on Anthropic provider

I added the Anthropic model provider and plugged my key, but the Claude Opus 5 model shows that it only supports a 116K context window and no vision, which is false; it should be configured the same way as Claude Opus 4.8 is.

@bhavyaus Is there a way to prevent this from happening again for every new model added by Anthropic?

Devcontainer support in Github APP

Devcontainer is core for developer while currently GitHub Copilot Desktop APP don't support the integration and that's major blocker for any project using devcontainer on top of the "native" sandboxing devcontainer offer.

